Hi David,
We aren't typically setup to analyze R code, but I believe that what is happening here is that .indexwday is being impacted by the timezone that shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> runs in. I don't know enough about .indexwday to know if you can pass in the timezone explicitly which would then fix the issue.

-Tareef

